WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.639
Read the video transcript The brief starts with the

00:00:02.692 --> 00:00:07.166
result requested and the existing constraint Put the supplier

00:00:07.245 --> 00:00:09.824
conflict beside the diary facts so the reader can

00:00:09.955 --> 00:00:14.100
see why a decision is needed Compare feasible options

00:00:14.442 --> 00:00:18.981
recommend one and explain why Name the decision required

00:00:19.928 --> 00:00:23.718
Then list unresolved approval and acceptance conditions rather than

00:00:23.771 --> 00:00:27.731
presenting them as settled facts Write your own first

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:31.574
brief before opening the later case update You will

00:00:31.626 --> 00:00:36.153
compare it with subsequent confirmed information without pretending that

00:00:36.192 --> 00:00:38.416
you knew those later facts at the start
